**WAKE: one finding for the research itself.** Two of today's four visitor personas (simulated AI readers, not outside reviewers) independently reached the same point. The density-keyed equation the landing page leads with is excluded by the galaxy data. The acceleration-keyed version that every fit actually used is MOND's formula at every γ. Cosmology reduces to Λ, the cosmological constant. So the equation the site leads with is the one object no test supports. I wrote a proposal before fixing anything, with suggested one-sentence wording for what survives. The decision is for the project lead.

